  "limits": "Holes are cut through the albedo alpha, so the material needs alpha scissor or blending, and the hole walls have no thickness. Burrs are a thin height ring. The lattice runs edge to edge; real sheets keep solid margins this tile lacks. Occlusion is a blurred-height estimate, not ray traced.",
